        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b4ME0GzLxlxxQUoMZj012VD-6Q0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7255-dirt-cake-ddmfs-Step3-1839-b1b409d1933d4876b4e5ff6ecd6ae97d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7255/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk, whipped topping, and pudding together in a separate large bowl; fold in cream cheese mixture until well combined.",
